      "role": "Uppercase section label above feature titles",
      "description": "11–12px, weight 500, text in #d97706 (Ember) or #202020, letter-spacing 0.2em (20%), uppercase. Optionally preceded by a small 16px filled icon. Examples: 'INSTANT MODE' with a lightning-bolt icon, '3 MODES' in the section header."
