      "name": "Feature Card",
      "role": "Container for feature highlights within a section",
      "description": "White (#fcfcfc) background, 1px #e0e0e0 border, 12px radius, 24px padding. No drop shadow by default; optional 0px 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05) lift for elevated variants. Content is image-on-top, text-below with 12px gap."
